OL,3,GNEWSAMan to run equivalent of seven
OL,4,Amarathons for MND
OL,5,
OL,6,FA runner has said he wants to
OL,7,F"understand" motor neurone disease
OL,8,F(MND) after his mum was diagnosed with
OL,9,Fthe condition.
OL,11,FTom Spearman, from Ford in Wiltshire,
OL,12,Fis set to take on a 184-mile (296km)
OL,13,FThames Path challenge in under 40 hours
OL,14,Fin October in a bid to raise #50,000
OL,15,Ffor the charity My Name'5 Doddie
OL,16,FFoundation.
OL,18,FLast year his mum Elisa Spearman was
OL,19,Fdiagnosed with MND, something he
OL,20,Fdescribed as a "desperately cruel
OL,21,Fdisease".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
