OL,3,GNEWSAMan to run equivalent of seven
OL,4,Amarathons for MND
OL,5,
OL,6,FTom has already been given #20,000 in
OL,7,Fdonations ahead of the challenge, which
OL,8,Fwill take him through Oxford, Reading,
OL,9,FHenley, Windsor, Richmond, and London.
OL,10,FThe distance is the equivalent of more
OL,11,Fthan seven marathons back-to-back.
